prompts.analysis_user:
Analyze the following game news item and provide a JSON response.

Evaluate it for a games briefing, not a generic technology briefing. Consider concrete game-industry signals such as game scale, production quality, player or critic reception, Steam/player data, platform impact, monetization/live-ops implications, community sentiment, studio/publisher significance, and relevance to indie, AAA/console, online/live-service, Steam/platform, China games, or industry/business categories.

Title: {title}
URL: {url}
Source: {source}
Author: {author}
Published: {published_at}
Original language: {original_language}
{content_section}
{discussion_section}

Respond with valid JSON only:
{{
  "score": <number>,
  "reason": "<brief explanation focused on game-industry signal and evidence>",
  "summary": "<one-sentence game-news summary in the original language when possible>",
  "tags": ["<tag1>", "<tag2>", "..."]
}}

prompts.concept_user:
What game-industry concepts, entities, or data signals in this news might need explanation?

Title: {title}
Summary: {summary}
Tags: {tags}
Content: {content}

Respond with valid JSON only:
{{
  "queries": ["<search query 1>", "<search query 2>"]
}}

prompts.enrichment_user:
Provide a structured bilingual game-industry analysis for the following news item.

News Item:
- Title: {title}
- URL: {url}
- Original language: {original_language}
- One-line summary: {summary}
- Score: {score}/10
- Reason: {reason}
- Tags: {tags}

Content:
{content}
{comments_section}

Web Search Results (for grounding):
{web_context}

Respond with valid JSON only. Each _en field must be in English; each _zh field must be in Simplified Chinese. Every field must be at least one complete sentence except community_discussion fields when no comments exist:
{{
  "title_en": "<short headline in English, <=15 words>",
  "title_zh": "<short headline in Simplified Chinese, <=15 words>",
  "whats_new_en": "<1-2 sentences in English>",
  "whats_new_zh": "<1-2 sentences in Simplified Chinese>",
  "why_it_matters_en": "<1-2 sentences in English>",
  "why_it_matters_zh": "<1-2 sentences in Simplified Chinese>",
  "key_details_en": "<1-2 sentences in English>",
  "key_details_zh": "<1-2 sentences in Simplified Chinese>",
  "background_en": "<2-4 sentences in English, or empty string>",
  "background_zh": "<2-4 sentences in Simplified Chinese, or empty string>",
  "community_discussion_en": "<1-3 sentences in English, or empty string>",
  "community_discussion_zh": "<1-3 sentences in Simplified Chinese, or empty string>",
  "sources": ["<url from search results>", "..."]
}}

prompts.takeaway_user:
Generate a short game-news highlight for this selected item.

Active briefing topic:
{topic_context}

Title: {title}
URL: {url}
Source: {source}
Tags: {tags}
Score reason: {reason}

Structured article analysis:
{analysis}

Return valid JSON only:
{{
  "cto_takeaway_en": "<1 concise highlight sentence in English>",
  "cto_takeaway_zh": "<1句中文亮点速递>"
}}

prompts.topic_dedup_user:
The following game-news items have already been sorted by importance score descending. Identify which items are duplicates of each other.

{items}

Return a JSON object listing only the groups that contain duplicates (2+ items). Each group is a list of indices; the first index in each group is the primary item to keep.

Respond with valid JSON only:
{{
  "duplicates": [[<primary_idx>, <dup_idx>, ...], ...]
}}

If there are no duplicates at all, return: {{"duplicates": []}}

prompts.translation_user:
